{"id":"2e7227755a8473e0","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus.md","title":"Arithmetical Proof Calculus","display":"df-arithmetical-proof-calculus — Arithmetical Proof Calculus","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus","aliases":["89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus"],"display":"df-arithmetical-proof-calculus — Arithmetical Proof Calculus","depends_on":["[[89-df-arithmetical-language]]","[[89-df-first-order-formula]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-09"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-arithmetical-proof-calculus — Arithmetical Proof Calculus"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a257e5b1de6880b7\" href=\"?note=a257e5b1de6880b7\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-language\">89-df-arithmetical-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ec3012ebbfa291bf\" href=\"?note=ec3012ebbfa291bf\" title=\"89-df-first-order-formula\">89-df-first-order-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-09"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L=(C,F,a_F,P,a_P)\">\\(\\mathcal L=(C,F,a_F,P,a_P)\\)</span> 为本书一阶签名，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,u\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)\">\\(t,u\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf V\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf V\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\mathcal L)\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\mathcal L)\\)</span>；算术实例取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(\\mathcal L=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{At}_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\mathsf{At}_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span> 把量词公式视为不可再作命题分解的原子；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e:\\mathsf{At}_{\\mathcal L}\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(e:\\mathsf{At}_{\\mathcal L}\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>。替换采用已定义的避免捕获操作，因此量词实例允许先作必需的绑定变量改名。</li>\n<li>下述规则只从无开放理论假设的证明行作全称化；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的元素均为句子。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span> 在指定一阶理论的上下文中省略语言标签。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetical\\text{-}proof\\text{-}calculus}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{At}_{\\mathcal L}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{t\\doteq u\\mid t,u\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)\\}\\cup\\{R(\\vec t)\\mid R\\in P,\\ \\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)^{a_P(R)}\\}\n\\cup\\{\\forall x A\\mid x\\in\\mathsf V,\\ A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\},\\\\\nv_e(C)&amp;\\coloneqq e(C)\\ (C\\in\\mathsf{At}_{\\mathcal L}),\\quad\nv_e(\\neg A)\\coloneqq1-v_e(A),\\quad v_e(A\\lor B)\\coloneqq\\max(v_e(A),v_e(B)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Taut}_{\\mathcal L}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\mid\\forall e:\\mathsf{At}_{\\mathcal L}\\to\\{0,1\\}\\ v_e(A)=1\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{LogAx}_{\\mathcal L}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Taut}_{\\mathcal L}\n\\cup\\{\\forall x A\\to A[t/x]\\mid A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L),\\ t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L),\\ x\\in\\mathsf V\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\forall x(A\\to B)\\to(A\\to\\forall xB)\\mid A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L),\\ x\\in\\mathsf V\\setminus\\mathrm{FV}(A)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{t\\doteq t\\mid t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{t\\doteq u\\to(A[t/x]\\to A[u/x])\\mid t,u\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L),\\ A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L),\\ x\\in\\mathsf V\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{LogAx}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{LogAx}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{PA}}},\\\\\n\\mathsf{Der}_{\\mathcal L}(T,s)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\ns\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)^{&lt;\\omega}\\land |s|&gt;0\\land\n\\forall i&lt;|s|\\bigl(s_i\\in T\\cup\\mathsf{LogAx}_{\\mathcal L}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{25mm}\\lor\\exists j,k&lt;i\\ (s_k=(s_j\\to s_i))\n\\lor\\exists j&lt;i\\ \\exists x\\in\\mathsf V\\ (s_i=\\forall x s_j)\\bigr),\\\\\nT\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}A&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists s\\ [\\mathsf{Der}_{\\mathcal L}(T,s)\\land s_{|s|-1}=A],\\\\\nT\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}A&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow T\\vdash_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{PA}}}A.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetical\\text{-}proof\\text{-}calculus}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{At}_{\\mathcal L}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{t\\doteq u\\mid t,u\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)\\}\\cup\\{R(\\vec t)\\mid R\\in P,\\ \\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)^{a_P(R)}\\}\n\\cup\\{\\forall x A\\mid x\\in\\mathsf V,\\ A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\},\\\\\nv_e(C)&amp;\\coloneqq e(C)\\ (C\\in\\mathsf{At}_{\\mathcal L}),\\quad\nv_e(\\neg A)\\coloneqq1-v_e(A),\\quad v_e(A\\lor B)\\coloneqq\\max(v_e(A),v_e(B)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Taut}_{\\mathcal L}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\mid\\forall e:\\mathsf{At}_{\\mathcal L}\\to\\{0,1\\}\\ v_e(A)=1\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{LogAx}_{\\mathcal L}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Taut}_{\\mathcal L}\n\\cup\\{\\forall x A\\to A[t/x]\\mid A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L),\\ t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L),\\ x\\in\\mathsf V\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\forall x(A\\to B)\\to(A\\to\\forall xB)\\mid A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L),\\ x\\in\\mathsf V\\setminus\\mathrm{FV}(A)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{t\\doteq t\\mid t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{t\\doteq u\\to(A[t/x]\\to A[u/x])\\mid t,u\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L),\\ A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L),\\ x\\in\\mathsf V\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{LogAx}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{LogAx}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{PA}}},\\\\\n\\mathsf{Der}_{\\mathcal L}(T,s)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\ns\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)^{&lt;\\omega}\\land |s|&gt;0\\land\n\\forall i&lt;|s|\\bigl(s_i\\in T\\cup\\mathsf{LogAx}_{\\mathcal L}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{25mm}\\lor\\exists j,k&lt;i\\ (s_k=(s_j\\to s_i))\n\\lor\\exists j&lt;i\\ \\exists x\\in\\mathsf V\\ (s_i=\\forall x s_j)\\bigr),\\\\\nT\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}A&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists s\\ [\\mathsf{Der}_{\\mathcal L}(T,s)\\land s_{|s|-1}=A],\\\\\nT\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}A&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow T\\vdash_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{PA}}}A.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 2 章，印刷页 15–20；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n固定通常的经典一阶等号演算，写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash A\">\\(T\\vdash A\\)</span> 时采用本关系。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的公理都是句子，因此全称化不受开放理论假设的变量条件影响；若讨论开放假设的局部推导，必须另加全称化的限制。对仅可枚举的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>，证明码还保存公理被枚举出的有限计算证书，不能直接把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in T\">\\(A_i\\in T\\)</span> 当作可判定检查。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-arithmetical-language","status":"resolved","id":"a257e5b1de6880b7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-first-order-formula","status":"resolved","id":"ec3012ebbfa291bf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-first-order-formula]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L=(C,F,a_F,P,a_P)","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"t,u\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathsf V","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{PA}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{At}_{\\mathcal L}","display":false},{"tex":"e:\\mathsf{At}_{\\mathcal L}\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetical\\text{-}proof\\text{-}calculus}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{At}_{\\mathcal L}&\\coloneqq\\{t\\doteq u\\mid t,u\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)\\}\\cup\\{R(\\vec t)\\mid R\\in P,\\ \\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)^{a_P(R)}\\}\n\\cup\\{\\forall x A\\mid x\\in\\mathsf V,\\ A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\},\\\\\nv_e(C)&\\coloneqq e(C)\\ (C\\in\\mathsf{At}_{\\mathcal L}),\\quad\nv_e(\\neg A)\\coloneqq1-v_e(A),\\quad v_e(A\\lor B)\\coloneqq\\max(v_e(A),v_e(B)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Taut}_{\\mathcal L}&\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\mid\\forall e:\\mathsf{At}_{\\mathcal L}\\to\\{0,1\\}\\ v_e(A)=1\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{LogAx}_{\\mathcal L}&\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Taut}_{\\mathcal L}\n\\cup\\{\\forall x A\\to A[t/x]\\mid A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L),\\ t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L),\\ x\\in\\mathsf V\\}\\\\\n&\\quad\\cup\\{\\forall x(A\\to B)\\to(A\\to\\forall xB)\\mid A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L),\\ x\\in\\mathsf V\\setminus\\mathrm{FV}(A)\\}\\\\\n&\\quad\\cup\\{t\\doteq t\\mid t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)\\}\\\\\n&\\quad\\cup\\{t\\doteq u\\to(A[t/x]\\to A[u/x])\\mid t,u\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L),\\ A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L),\\ x\\in\\mathsf V\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{LogAx}&\\coloneqq\\mathsf{LogAx}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{PA}}},\\\\\n\\mathsf{Der}_{\\mathcal L}(T,s)&\\Longleftrightarrow\ns\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)^{<\\omega}\\land |s|>0\\land\n\\forall i<|s|\\bigl(s_i\\in T\\cup\\mathsf{LogAx}_{\\mathcal L}\\\\\n&\\hspace{25mm}\\lor\\exists j,k<i\\ (s_k=(s_j\\to s_i))\n\\lor\\exists j<i\\ \\exists x\\in\\mathsf V\\ (s_i=\\forall x s_j)\\bigr),\\\\\nT\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}A&\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists s\\ [\\mathsf{Der}_{\\mathcal L}(T,s)\\land s_{|s|-1}=A],\\\\\nT\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}A&\\Longleftrightarrow T\\vdash_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{PA}}}A.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"T\\vdash A","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"A_i\\in T","display":false}],"bytes":3307,"backlinks":[{"id":"508219e8b4c7dadf","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"2695165f0444a6d1","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"86ad48bbd1843ed6","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"76cab88fafa3b379","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"841985de31202f85","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"2d52ad4f119b4a14","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"22c2c4cecc692616","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"571230a8af3bcd56","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4a8ab8e4bad7b12d","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a1c8bb923975db7e","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-35","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-50","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-language]] → [[89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus]] → [[89-df-peano-arithmetic]] → [[89-d